#: ../../../DirectX/SemanticSignatures.md:108
msgid "Derived Container Fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../DirectX/SemanticSignatures.md:110
msgid "The following container fields are derived from the operands above:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../DirectX/SemanticSignatures.md:112
msgid ""
"**Allocated**: allocated iff `StartRow != -1` and `StartCol != -1` (the "
"sentinels are always set together)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../DirectX/SemanticSignatures.md:114
msgid "**DeclaredMask**: `((1 << Cols) - 1) << StartCol`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../DirectX/SemanticSignatures.md:115
msgid ""
"**AlwaysReads / NeverWrites**: `UsageMask` is written to `AlwaysReads` for "
"inputs; for outputs `NeverWrites = ~UsageMask & DeclaredMask`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../DirectX/SemanticSignatures.md:117
msgid ""
"**MinPrecision**: from `CompType` plus the `UseMinPrecision` module flag."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../DirectX/SemanticSignatures.md:126
msgid ""
"A metadata node of one or more semantic indices. Its length must equal the "
"`Rows` field of the containing signature element."
msgstr ""
